    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax. Click. Accumulate Karma.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merit Pet</strong> is a cute and peaceful 2D pixel desktop companion game designed to brighten up your idle time. Tap the wooden fish to earn merit points, unlock adorable pets, decorations, and backgrounds, and try your luck in casual mini-games like the Lucky Wheel and Scratch Card!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>auto-clicking mode</strong>, the pet continues meditating for you even when you're away. Whether you're working, studying, or simply chilling, Merit Pet offers gentle companionship and fun surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the wooden fish and earn karma points \u2014 satisfyingly simple</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779790/extras/d8d1fa97c2b3defaefb3c9becc6aa21f.poster.avif?t=1749096970\" width=616 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779790/extras/d8d1fa97c2b3defaefb3c9becc6aa21f.webm?t=1749096970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779790/extras/d8d1fa97c2b3defaefb3c9becc6aa21f.mp4?t=1749096970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your pet, wooden fish, and pixel background</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779790/extras/785f615173ba301c216869c7168aba58.poster.avif?t=1749096970\" width=616 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779790/extras/785f615173ba301c216869c7168aba58.webm?t=1749096970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779790/extras/785f615173ba301c216869c7168aba58.mp4?t=1749096970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play luck-based mini-games like the Lucky Wheel and Scratch Card</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779790/extras/197fc66afd1228847af046765d728b16.poster.avif?t=1749096970\" width=616 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779790/extras/197fc66afd1228847af046765d728b16.webm?t=1749096970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779790/extras/197fc66afd1228847af046765d728b16.mp4?t=1749096970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779790/extras/854933df96657e892329ef5998de50aa.poster.avif?t=1749096970\" width=616 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779790/extras/854933df96657e892329ef5998de50aa.webm?t=1749096970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779790/extras/854933df96657e892329ef5998de50aa.mp4?t=1749096970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle mode: Let your pet meditate for you while you focus elsewhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming pixel-art visuals and multi-language support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Future Update Plans</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned features in upcoming updates include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New mini-games such as Whack-a-Mole and Merit Tower stacking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Typing Mode&quot;: Your pet knocks the wooden fish in sync with your keystrokes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blessing System: Use merits to draw fortunes and gain special effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop support: upload and share your own backgrounds, characters, and wooden fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for more languages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More characters and interactive events to enrich your virtual companion</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax. Click. Accumulate Karma.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merit Pet</strong> is a cute and peaceful 2D pixel desktop companion game designed to brighten up your idle time. Tap the wooden fish to earn merit points, unlock adorable pets, decorations, and backgrounds, and try your luck in casual mini-games like the Lucky Wheel and Scratch Card!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>auto-clicking mode</strong>, the pet continues meditating for you even when you're away. Whether you're working, studying, or simply chilling, Merit Pet offers gentle companionship and fun surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the wooden fish and earn karma points \u2014 satisfyingly simple</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779790/extras/d8d1fa97c2b3defaefb3c9becc6aa21f.poster.avif?t=1749096970\" width=616 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779790/extras/d8d1fa97c2b3defaefb3c9becc6aa21f.webm?t=1749096970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779790/extras/d8d1fa97c2b3defaefb3c9becc6aa21f.mp4?t=1749096970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your pet, wooden fish, and pixel background</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779790/extras/785f615173ba301c216869c7168aba58.poster.avif?t=1749096970\" width=616 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779790/extras/785f615173ba301c216869c7168aba58.webm?t=1749096970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779790/extras/785f615173ba301c216869c7168aba58.mp4?t=1749096970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play luck-based mini-games like the Lucky Wheel and Scratch Card</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779790/extras/197fc66afd1228847af046765d728b16.poster.avif?t=1749096970\" width=616 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779790/extras/197fc66afd1228847af046765d728b16.webm?t=1749096970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779790/extras/197fc66afd1228847af046765d728b16.mp4?t=1749096970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779790/extras/854933df96657e892329ef5998de50aa.poster.avif?t=1749096970\" width=616 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779790/extras/854933df96657e892329ef5998de50aa.webm?t=1749096970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779790/extras/854933df96657e892329ef5998de50aa.mp4?t=1749096970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle mode: Let your pet meditate for you while you focus elsewhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming pixel-art visuals and multi-language support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Future Update Plans</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned features in upcoming updates include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New mini-games such as Whack-a-Mole and Merit Tower stacking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Typing Mode&quot;: Your pet knocks the wooden fish in sync with your keystrokes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blessing System: Use merits to draw fortunes and gain special effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop support: upload and share your own backgrounds, characters, and wooden fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for more languages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More characters and interactive events to enrich your virtual companion</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
